        -:    1:// Contended-queue microbenchmark for the C++ implementation.
        -:    2://
        -:    3:// Isolates the bounded blocking queue and one-shot completion primitives that
        -:    4:// the full service uses under overload, without ShardCore work in the path.
        -:    5:// N producer threads each push a job carrying a std::promise and block on the
        -:    6:// matching std::future; one consumer thread pops and signals completion.
        -:    7://
        -:    8:// Mirrors rust/examples/queue_contention.rs operation for operation.
